    "name": "Rocket Engineer",
    "steam_appid": 2689960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your rockets, launch them into orbit, extract resources from other worlds, and expand your presence into the solar system of Rocket Engineer. From the design of your own rockets, to your own colonies and launch sites, you have the freedom of exploration, expansion, and industry. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colonies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonies allow you to extract resources, transform them, and use them for building rockets away from Earth. But be aware, workers are required and a constant food and water supply is imperative for them to keep them conscious, and even better, productive. Should they all go unconscious, any production would stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully simulated solar system</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Engineer features a realistic physics system that allows you to propel your craft to new worlds, or to crash them spectacularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part and building variety</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From assembly storage to launchpad, from reaction wheel to colony founder, Rocket Engineer offers a wide variety of rocket parts to design the rocket you need. Each part has its own properties, allowing you to choose the right part for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is at the core of Rocket Engineer\u2019s iterative development. Suggestions and feedback will be taken into account every step of the way, as well as throughout the whole life of Rocket Engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your rockets, launch them into orbit, extract resources from other worlds, and expand your presence into the solar system of Rocket Engineer. From the design of your own rockets, to your own colonies and launch sites, you have the freedom of exploration, expansion, and industry. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colonies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonies allow you to extract resources, transform them, and use them for building rockets away from Earth. But be aware, workers are required and a constant food and water supply is imperative for them to keep them conscious, and even better, productive. Should they all go unconscious, any production would stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/7cbab43cb726bdc932985acafbda1b34.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully simulated solar system</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Engineer features a realistic physics system that allows you to propel your craft to new worlds, or to crash them spectacularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/de53d18d494aef54df7889559de23fe3.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Part and building variety</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From assembly storage to launchpad, from reaction wheel to colony founder, Rocket Engineer offers a wide variety of rocket parts to design the rocket you need. Each part has its own properties, allowing you to choose the right part for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/5a348124dba50134ae8ee2b77312c5a9.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is at the core of Rocket Engineer\u2019s iterative development. Suggestions and feedback will be taken into account every step of the way, as well as throughout the whole life of Rocket Engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.poster.avif?t=1744850839\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.webm?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689960/extras/487f94d3601059670400cb4bb2861388.mp4?t=1744850839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
